			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Xilonen"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1343.265,
							198.891,
							7177.317
						],
						"pointId": 350400211
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1340.089,
							199.175,
							7180.244
						],
						"pointId": 350400244
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1342.486,
							198.978,
							7179.928
						],
						"pointId": 350400245
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 755050201,
					"content": "This is our spot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050202,
					"content": "See that? An Aphid, polluted with the power of the Abyss. Way larger than any normal one ever gets.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050203,
					"content": "Whoa, what a huge Aphid... Uh, is it dangerous?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050204,
					"content": "Relax, even though it's been contaminated by the Abyss, its behavior doesn't seem to have changed at all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050205,
					"content": "Still, I've specially prepared an extra-large insect net to make sure everything goes smoothly. Here ya go. It'll come in handy for catching them in a moment.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050206,
					"content": "Oh right! By the way, Kinich mentioned something rather unusual. He discovered that there's a special berry that always grows near areas where Abyssal Aphids are found.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050207,
					"content": "The berry contains a toxin that can paralyze the Aphids, so if we spread them on the net, it'll stop the Aphids from struggling.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050208,
					"content": "Huh? Why are Aphids living around a berry that paralyzes them? Seems kinda strange to Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050209,
					"content": "I think so too. First time I've heard of animals living alongside something that's dangerous to them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050210,
					"content": "It's totally unnatural! Wait... Could someone be behind them getting infected with the Abyss!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050211,
					"content": "Paimon's sure on high alert these days.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050212
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 755050212,
					"content": "Hey! Even the dumbest guides grow up! And Paimon was never dumb to start with anyway.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050213,
					"content": "The only problem with that is that we searched everywhere, but didn't find any trace of human involvement.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050214,
					"content": "So let's just chalk it up to some unknown natural Aphid behavior for now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						755050215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xilonen"
				},
				{
					"id": 755050215,
					"content": "Fine, but no matter what, we've got to catch them first! We don't want anything else that makes people sick running around.",
